 the other side of the system, and traders like you. Kallay isn't a massive place, and visitors usually don't come alone; how you respond to different situations may affect you later on.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962430/extras/97809139a2094d42494b41f7d7b079d9.avif?t=1764249791\" alt=\"Sell Your Ielsek\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962430/extras_big/97809139a2094d42494b41f7d7b079d9.webp?t=1764249791 width=1560 height=183 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962430/extras/09922cd8507a809a868dcebeb57adc76.poster.avif?t=1764249791\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962430/extras/09922cd8507a809a868dcebeb57adc76.webm?t=1764249791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962430/extras/09922cd8507a809a868dcebeb57adc76.mp4?t=1764249791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've brought a shipment of a valuable resource called <i>ielsek</i> to Kallay, but to make sales, you'll need to understand how your potential customers speak and think. Your background as a Guressi (someone from the exiled planet of Guressen) may complicate sales and lead to unsavory interactions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962430/extras/da53ce3e55d891399bade1209ef77a29.avif?t=1764249791\" alt=\"Uncover Kallay&#039;s Secrets\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962430/extras_big/da53ce3e55d891399bade1209ef